{
  "bodyHash": "pPEXtN5ngo4=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum Mod。用心製作。大量適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍 Mod！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">快速右鍵是一款提升生活品質的模組，讓玩家能夠快速使用許多功能性方塊，而無需實際放置它們。只需在空中對物品按右鍵，不要瞄準任何方塊。快速在床上睡覺、存取你的終界箱或打開界伏盒。有些會直接打開，有些則會自動放置。請參考下方的 GIF 範例以更了解其運作方式。<br><br>適用於：<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">床、製圖台、工作台、終界箱、砂輪、界伏盒、鍛造台和切石機。</span></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的生活品質包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickBeds</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對床按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickCartographyTables</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對製圖台按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickCraftingTables</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對工作台按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickEnderChests</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對終界箱按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickGrindstones</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對砂輪按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickShulkerBoxes</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對界伏盒按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickSmithingTables</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對鍛造台按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableQuickStonecutters</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，在空中對切石機按右鍵將觸發快速功能。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速在床上睡覺。它會被自動放置，睡眠完成後自動拾起。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速存取你的終界箱，無需使用絲綢之觸來拾起它。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速打開界伏盒，存取其內容後即可繼續前進。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">快速合成物品，無需在每個地方留下工作台。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">也適用於製圖台和其他村莊職業方塊。</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/quick-right-click/e.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>你可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多單獨的模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
